{
    // =========================
    // POWER SUPPLY RUN
    // =========================
    "699a84bf8e2052342f79b912 name": "Power Supply Run",
    "699a84bf8e2052342f79b912 description": "I don’t waste time on introductions. Power is the only thing keeping parts of Tarkov alive — not lights, not generators, but the systems behind them. Communications, surveillance, private grids that never went offline. Someone is maintaining them. Someone is profiting from them. That should be me. Bring me working components from active zones. If it still functions, it has value. And if it has value, it belongs to someone. Now it belongs to me.",
    "699a84bf8e2052342f79b912 startedMessageText": "Working components only. If it wasn’t recovered during an operation, it’s worthless.",
    "699a84bf8e2052342f79b912 successMessageText": "Good. Clean hardware. That’s how I like it.",
    "699a84bf8e2052342f79b912 completePlayerMessage": "Components delivered.",
    "699a84bf8e2052342f79b912 note": "Recover working electronics in raid.",

    "22c12c8303c9175e1e48ccd5": "Find 2 Power Cords in raid",
