    // =========================
    // BIG MAGS WANTED
    // =========================
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 name": "Big Mags Wanted",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 description": "I’ve watched enough fights to know how they really end. Not with a clean shot, but with someone running empty at the wrong time. I don’t allow that. The people working with me don’t rely on timing — they remove it. Extended magazines are becoming rare, and the ones still in circulation are being held by people who understand their worth. I want them before they disappear.",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 startedMessageText": "Capacity matters. Bring me magazines that don’t run dry too soon.",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 successMessageText": "Good. More rounds before silence.",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 completePlayerMessage": "Magazines delivered.",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 note": "Acquire extended magazines.",

