    // =========================
    // CROSSED WIRES
    // =========================
    "69d81d08b08a9cf2a881f70e name": "Crossed Wires",
    "69d81d08b08a9cf2a881f70e description": "Everything in Tarkov is connected. Military supply, private trade, black market movement. I don’t need all of it gone. I need one piece weakened. You’re going to choose which one.",
    "69d81d08b08a9cf2a881f70e startedMessageText": "Choose carefully.",
    "69d81d08b08a9cf2a881f70e successMessageText": "Good. That changes things.",
    "69d81d08b08a9cf2a881f70e completePlayerMessage": "Target disabled.",
    "69d81d08b08a9cf2a881f70e note": "Sabotage chosen network.",

    "603207d9f2bef8d2219dd0ca": "Sabotage the network",
    "57f8473740b35132ec9a0012": "Extract safely",

    // =========================
    // BLOOD OATH (LOYAL)
    // =========================
    "69d81d10f141ade1c2f23cbd name": "Blood Oath",
    "69d81d10f141ade1c2f23cbd description": "You made your choice when you cut the right line. Most people in Tarkov sell loyalty by the hour, then act surprised when they die alone. I have no use for that kind of man. Up to now, you’ve been useful. Now I need to know whether you can be trusted when the pressure stops being theoretical. Use what I’ve given you. Spill blood with my weapons, for my interests, and make your position clear to anyone still uncertain.",
    "69d81d10f141ade1c2f23cbd startedMessageText": "This is where usefulness becomes loyalty. Use my equipment and finish the work.",
    "69d81d10f141ade1c2f23cbd successMessageText": "Good. Loyalty means something only when it costs blood.",
    "69d81d10f141ade1c2f23cbd completePlayerMessage": "Targets are down. Your weapons performed.",
    "69d81d10f141ade1c2f23cbd note": "Use Tony’s equipment to eliminate his enemies.",

    "ed9c12d309e06158faa7f816": "Eliminate PMCs using Tony equipment",

    // =========================
    // CLEAN HOUSE (LOYAL)
    // =========================
    "69d81d2211b64abb3f86ee12 name": "Clean House",
    "69d81d2211b64abb3f86ee12 description": "Now that people have seen where you stand, the rest becomes simpler. There are men tied to my operations who’ve grown careless, greedy, or afraid. In my world, all three become betrayal eventually. They knew the rules when they took the money. Remove them before hesitation spreads further than rumor already has. Quietly, efficiently, and without leaving this mess for me twice.",
    "69d81d2211b64abb3f86ee12 startedMessageText": "Loose ends don’t stay loose for long. Handle them.",
    "69d81d2211b64abb3f86ee12 successMessageText": "Good. Stability is expensive. You’ve just paid part of the cost.",
    "69d81d2211b64abb3f86ee12 completePlayerMessage": "The compromised men are gone.",
    "69d81d2211b64abb3f86ee12 note": "Eliminate compromised operatives and restore control.",

    "1e9026da7e4c46af8c992148": "Eliminate targets on Streets",

    // =========================
    // THE NEW BOSS (LOYAL)
    // =========================
    "69d81d2e489341684c932b76 name": "The New Boss",
    "69d81d2e489341684c932b76 description": "Control isn’t declared in Tarkov. It’s demonstrated. Quietly, repeatedly, until resistance becomes a bad habit with a short life expectancy. Everything before this was preparation — routes, records, shipments, loyalties. This is the moment those pieces become structure. Secure the location, remove resistance, and make it clear that what remains of this city’s black market answers to me. You’ve come this far. Finish it, and you won’t just be another contractor in the books. You’ll be part of what comes next.",
    "69d81d2e489341684c932b76 startedMessageText": "No mistakes now. This is the part people remember.",
    "69d81d2e489341684c932b76 successMessageText": "It’s done. Control is established, and properly this time.",
    "69d81d2e489341684c932b76 completePlayerMessage": "The location is secured. Resistance is gone.",
    "69d81d2e489341684c932b76 note": "Secure Tony’s position and eliminate all remaining resistance.",

    "fd122acd465f88fd577be25f": "Eliminate all resistance",
    "05ebbaa447ffa8affb05b1f1": "Survive and extract",

    // =========================
    // LOOSE ENDS (BETRAY)
    // =========================
    "69d81d3d82a2da467ea1fdba name": "Loose Ends",
    "69d81d3d82a2da467ea1fdba description": "Tony believes control comes from knowing more than everyone else in the room. Men like that rarely notice when someone stops being part of the room. You’ve seen enough of his operation now to understand where it bends and where it breaks. There are buyers for that kind of knowledge, and unlike Tony, they don’t ask for loyalty — just results. Plant the tracker, walk away clean, and let the people paying for this do the rest. He doesn’t need to know when the ground started shifting beneath him.",
    "69d81d3d82a2da467ea1fdba startedMessageText": "No heroics. Plant it, leave, and keep your name out of it.",
    "69d81d3d82a2da467ea1fdba successMessageText": "Clean work. He won’t notice until it matters.",
    "69d81d3d82a2da467ea1fdba completePlayerMessage": "Tracker planted. No one saw me.",
    "69d81d3d82a2da467ea1fdba note": "Plant a tracking device on Tony’s operation and extract undetected.",

    "a5ab7af2349a3ed39a36cb66": "Place tracking device",
    "04866af5282f607ef18a9a5c": "Extract safely",

